# Docker: http://localhost:5261 | dotnet run: http://localhost:5094
@host = http://localhost:5261

### Criar (aprovada: score >= 700 e renda >= 2000)
POST {{host}}/api/credit-analyses
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Maria", "income": 5000, "score": 750 }

### Criar (reprovada por score)
POST {{host}}/api/credit-analyses
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "João", "income": 5000, "score": 500 }

### Listar todas
GET {{host}}/api/credit-analyses

### Listar por status (Pending, Approved, Rejected)
GET {{host}}/api/credit-analyses?status=Approved

### Buscar por id
GET {{host}}/api/credit-analyses/1

### Atualizar (volta para Pending e é reavaliada)
PUT {{host}}/api/credit-analyses/2
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "João", "income": 5000, "score": 720 }

### Remover
DELETE {{host}}/api/credit-analyses/1

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health
